  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "How we grow your business with digital marketing",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-2\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-2\">How we grow your business with <span class=\"accent\">digital marketing</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Five building blocks. Most clients start with two or three and add more as results come in.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs tabs--side\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Building blocks\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-3-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"tabs-3-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-target\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-text\"><span class=\"tabs__tab-title\">Discovery and strategy</span><span class=\"tabs__tab-sub\">Research, channels, budget</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-3-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"tabs-3-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-text\"><span class=\"tabs__tab-title\">SEO and content</span><span class=\"tabs__tab-sub\">Search and AI visibility</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-3-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"tabs-3-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-megaphone\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-text\"><span class=\"tabs__tab-title\">Paid media and social</span><span class=\"tabs__tab-sub\">Ads that pay back</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-3-tab-3\" aria-controls=\"tabs-3-panel-3\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-mail\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-text\"><span class=\"tabs__tab-title\">Email and automation</span><span class=\"tabs__tab-sub\">Nurture and retain</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-3-tab-4\" aria-controls=\"tabs-3-panel-4\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chart\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tabs__tab-text\"><span class=\"tabs__tab-title\">Analytics and optimisation</span><span class=\"tabs__tab-sub\">Measure and improve</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panels\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-3-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-3-tab-0\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Start with a plan, not a guess</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We study your customers, competitors and numbers, then choose the channels and budget most likely to pay back.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Audience and competitor research</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Channel mix and budget planning</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Goals and KPIs agreed up front</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Marketing plan · Budget by channel</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-bars\"><div class=\"mock-bar mock-bar--you\"><span>SEO and content</span><em><i style=\"width:100%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">35%</span></div><div class=\"mock-bar\"><span>Google Ads</span><em><i style=\"width:80%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">28%</span></div><div class=\"mock-bar\"><span>LinkedIn Ads</span><em><i style=\"width:46%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">16%</span></div><div class=\"mock-bar\"><span>Email and automation</span><em><i style=\"width:31%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">11%</span></div><div class=\"mock-bar\"><span>Website and CRO</span><em><i style=\"width:29%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">10%</span></div></div><div class=\"mock-stats mock-stats--3\"><div class=\"mock-stat mock-stat--violet\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Monthly budget</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">$18K</div></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Target leads</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">220</div></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Target cost / lead</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">$82</div></div></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-3-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-3-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Be the answer people find</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Technical fixes, helpful content and authority building, so you show up in Google and in AI answers.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Technical and on-page SEO</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Guides, blogs and landing pages</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Keyword strategy and content calendar</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Organic traffic · 12 months</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><svg class=\"mock-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Organic sessions (thousands)\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g74700\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#8f2cf4\" stop-opacity=\"0.28\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#8f2cf4\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/></linearGradient></defs><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"12.0\" y2=\"12.0\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"47.5\" y2=\"47.5\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"83.0\" y2=\"83.0\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"118.5\" y2=\"118.5\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"622\" y1=\"154.0\" y2=\"154.0\" stroke=\"#efeaf2\"/><path d=\"M16.0,100.6 L71.1,96.1 L126.2,93.9 L181.3,87.2 L236.4,79.2 L291.5,73.9 L346.5,67.2 L401.6,60.5 L456.7,48.9 L511.8,42.7 L566.9,32.9 L622.0,24.9 L622.0,154 L16.0,154 Z\" fill=\"url(#g74700)\"/><path d=\"M16.0,100.6 L71.1,96.1 L126.2,93.9 L181.3,87.2 L236.4,79.2 L291.5,73.9 L346.5,67.2 L401.6,60.5 L456.7,48.9 L511.8,42.7 L566.9,32.9 L622.0,24.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8f2cf4\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"622.0\" cy=\"24.9\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8f2cf4\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"16.0\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jan</text><text x=\"126.2\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mar</text><text x=\"236.4\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\">May</text><text x=\"346.5\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Jul</text><text x=\"456.7\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sep</text><text x=\"566.9\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nov</text><text x=\"622.0\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dec</text></svg><div class=\"mock-legend\"><span><i style=\"background:#8f2cf4\"></i>Sessions</span></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-3-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-3-tab-2\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Reach buyers when they’re looking</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Google, Meta and LinkedIn campaigns with tight targeting, tested creative and budgets moved to what works.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Search, Shopping and display</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Social ads and remarketing</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Audience building and testing</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">All channels · Last 30 days</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-scroll\"><table class=\"mock-table\"><thead><tr><th>Campaign</th><th class=\"num\">Cost</th><th class=\"num\">Conv.</th><th class=\"num\">Cost / conv.</th><th class=\"num\">ROAS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Search · Services</td><td class=\"num\">$4,820</td><td class=\"num\">164</td><td class=\"num\">$29.39</td><td class=\"num\">4.2x</td></tr><tr><td>Meta · Lead form</td><td class=\"num\">$2,100</td><td class=\"num\">96</td><td class=\"num\">$21.88</td><td class=\"num\">3.1x</td></tr><tr><td>LinkedIn · ABM</td><td class=\"num\">$1,900</td><td class=\"num\">22</td><td class=\"num\">$86.36</td><td class=\"num\">5.6x</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-3-panel-3\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-3-tab-3\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Follow up with every lead</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Welcome series, nurture flows and newsletters that keep you top of mind and move people to buy.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Newsletters and drip campaigns</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> CRM integration and lead scoring</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Welcome, cart and lifecycle flows</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Lead nurture flow</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mk-flow\"><div class=\"mk-flow__step mk-flow__step--trigger\"><span class=\"mk-flow__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-zap\"/></svg></span><div><p class=\"mk-flow__label\">Form submitted</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\">Website enquiry</p></div></div><div class=\"mk-flow__step mk-flow__step--email\"><span class=\"mk-flow__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-mail\"/></svg></span><div><p class=\"mk-flow__label\">Welcome email</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\">Sent instantly</p></div></div><div class=\"mk-flow__step mk-flow__step--wait\"><span class=\"mk-flow__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-calendar\"/></svg></span><div><p class=\"mk-flow__label\">Wait 2 days</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"></p></div></div><div class=\"mk-flow__step mk-flow__step--split\"><span class=\"mk-flow__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-swap\"/></svg></span><div><p class=\"mk-flow__label\">Opened the email?</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\">Yes / no</p></div></div><div class=\"mk-flow__step mk-flow__step--email\"><span class=\"mk-flow__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-mail\"/></svg></span><div><p class=\"mk-flow__label\">Case study email</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\"></p></div></div><div class=\"mk-flow__step mk-flow__step--end\"><span class=\"mk-flow__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-target\"/></svg></span><div><p class=\"mk-flow__label\">Sales follow-up</p><p class=\"mk-place__meta\">Task in CRM</p></div></div></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-3-panel-4\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-3-tab-4\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Know what’s working</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>GA4, conversion tracking and dashboards, plus testing that turns more visitors into leads.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> GA4, tracking and dashboards</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> A/B testing and CRO</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Monthly reports and reviews</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Website funnel · Last 30 days</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mk-funnel\"><div class=\"mk-funnel__step\" style=\"--w:100%\"><span>Visitors</span><b>24,800</b></div><div class=\"mk-funnel__step\" style=\"--w:62%\"><span>Engaged</span><b>15,380</b></div><div class=\"mk-funnel__step\" style=\"--w:18%\"><span>Started form</span><b>4,460</b></div><div class=\"mk-funnel__step\" style=\"--w:6%\"><span>Leads</span><b>1,488</b></div></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "digital-marketing",
